sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Service
    participant SimpleDateFormat

    Client->>Service: convertDateString(dateString, defaultValue)
    Note right of Client: Client calls method with date string and default value

    Service->>SimpleDateFormat: new SimpleDateFormat("yyyyMMdd")
    Note right of Service: SimpleDateFormat created with yyyyMMdd pattern

    Service->>SimpleDateFormat: setTimeZone(TimeZone.getTimeZone("GMT"))
    Note right of Service: TimeZone set to GMT

    Service->>SimpleDateFormat: parse(dateString)
    Note right of Service: Attempts to parse text date string

    alt ParseException caught
        SimpleDateFormat-->>Service: throw ParseException
        Note right of SimpleDateFormat: Exception thrown for invalid date format

        Service->>Service: catch ParseException
        Note right of Service: Exception caught in try-catch block

        Service-->>Client: return defaultValue
        Note right of Service: Default Date value returned on exception
    else Success
        SimpleDateFormat-->>Service: return parsedDate
        Note right of SimpleDateFormat: Parsed Date object on success

        Service-->>Client: return parsedDate
        Note right of Service: Converted Date object
    end
